  "body": "Whether you are looking to take your first step onto the property ladder, seeking a high-yield investment, or ready to downsize without compromising on quality, this is the opportunity you've been waiting for. Complete with a 10 year Stamford warranty. \r\n\r\nNestled in the prestigious new Strathmill development in the Orewa hills, this contemporary single level 3-bedroom home offers the perfect blend of style, comfort, and convenience. Designed with modern living in mind, construction is slated for completion approximately six months from the confirmation of the purchase contract-meaning your brand-new lifestyle is just around the corner.  \r\n\r\nThe heart of the home features a seamless flow between the kitchen and living areas, perfect for family gatherings or entertaining friends on the patio. The Master Retreat enjoys a private ensuite with two bedrooms serviced by the modern bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe location enables you to enjoy the ease of commuting with quick and easy access to the North and South motorways.  Less than 5 minutes you're at the golden sands of Orewa Beach and the vibrant township filled with cafes, restaurants, and boutique shops.\r\n\r\nPriced to sell, don't delay on your enquiry.\r\n\r\nRenders are artist impression.  External finish is Grey Friars vertical weatherboard and  Light coloured brick. \r\n\r\n Set GPS to Mahinga Kai Road, take 1st right (Ara Taha Cresent), 2nd left is Moko Road.  Access through Flavell Drive is also now open.",
